                    {
                        "form_id": "3e52bd94-49cd-4940-aa16-6230a0982a88",
                        "entry_id": "99d6dcc4-3c31-3d2d-b519-9b9f44c1ce5a",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "иррегуля́рна"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1b540677-8105-4da8-ac5e-47970ffbc9d2",
                        "entry_id": "99d6dcc4-3c31-3d2d-b519-9b9f44c1ce5a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "иррегуля́рны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "09227e78-9176-3cc1-bc7a-1073d66d0c52",
                        "entry_id": "99d6dcc4-3c31-3d2d-b519-9b9f44c1ce5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. не имеющий чёткой организации, не подчиненный определённому порядку, уставу и т. п.; нерегулярный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67cd40ac-5f9b-43c8-bed4-98159e1fba58",
                                "sense_id": "09227e78-9176-3cc1-bc7a-1073d66d0c52",
                                "text": "С этого времени стало ясно, что спиральные, эллиптические и иррегулярные туманности являются родными сестрами нашего Млечного Пути."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b67f28e-fcf9-41bb-a0f4-4bc96cfd3f03",
                                "sense_id": "09227e78-9176-3cc1-bc7a-1073d66d0c52",
                                "text": "Мы не говорим здесь, конечно, о незначительных и случайных биономических отклонениях, как например, переход насекомого (часто невольный) с одного питающего растения на другое; такие отклонения, особенно, если они иррегулярны и непостоянны, не оказывают обыкновенно никакого влияния на признаки вида."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5c86a50-4bc8-38d7-bfa7-e9265ea89f1b",
                        "entry_id": "99d6dcc4-3c31-3d2d-b519-9b9f44c1ce5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воен. не входящий в состав регулярной армии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e23e06cf-a473-4279-a963-f2fe54231bfb",
                                "sense_id": "d5c86a50-4bc8-38d7-bfa7-e9265ea89f1b",
                                "text": "Иррегулярные войска вверенной мне армии остались на левом берегу сей реки для наблюдения и прикрытия правого фланга, и в сей день, а равно и 25-го числа препятствовали неприятелю распространиться своею позициею в сию сторону."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79f4afef-e236-4f2b-8543-b86b178a7210",
                        "source_entry_id": "99d6dcc4-3c31-3d2d-b519-9b9f44c1ce5a",
                        "target_lang_word": "irregular",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irregular",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a661dd03-1216-3dee-8bec-b2843946fd51",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nonstandard; not conforming to rules or expectations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b736c942-9698-44b2-8eba-448257b04935",
                                                "sense_id": "a661dd03-1216-3dee-8bec-b2843946fd51",
                                                "text": "‘ “It would be most irregular Grandpa!” says Miss Cecily frowning and tapping her foot. “Well, we’re a pretty irregular family so that’s neither here nor there,” says the old man, impish like. [...] ’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82eff117-4099-36fa-9190-7fd09281f5d5",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rough (of a surface)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without symmetry, regularity, or uniformity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f41c41a7-3e42-416b-862b-651ed4a878aa",
                                                "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                                "text": "The hovel stood in the centre of what had once been a vegetable garden, but was now a patch of rank weeds. Surrounding this, almost like a zareba, was an irregular ring of gorse and brambles, an unclaimed vestige of the original common."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78fe797d-382a-48cb-ac86-cb496435d142",
                                                "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                                "text": "Near by, where the crystal clear River Llugwy is crossed by a bridge, stands a small and ancient church built of massive, irregular boulders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4e4deae-94bb-4332-ba53-4ac05e49b70a",
                                                "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                                "text": "Many of these classic methods are still used, with some modern improvements. For example, with the aid of special microphones and automated sound detection software, ornithologists recently reported […] that pine siskins (Spinus pinus) undergo an irregular, nomadic type of nocturnal migration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b414eb41-95ed-4983-b440-40924569895a",
                                                "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                                "text": "Irregular bedtimes may disrupt healthy brain development in young children, according to a study of intelligence and sleeping habits. ¶ Going to bed at a different time each night affected girls more than boys, but both fared worse on mental tasks than children who had a set bedtime, researchers found."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f36bb147-843b-40dc-8b14-d4d26808bd52",
                                                "sense_id": "a371c451-1f15-3705-b7cb-ef26d40a8bb7",
                                                "text": "The improvements will be most keenly felt across Lincolnshire, where current irregular service patterns are more a function of operational convenience than passenger demand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72c829aa-2acd-37ab-bfab-530eb12ece68",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not regular; having sides that are not equal or angles that are not equal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a polygon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b755b81c-6de8-33fb-8441-0692384968ff",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Whose faces are not all regular polygons (or are not equally inclined to each other)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a polyhedron"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd543950-fa5e-3566-83e1-2be3d658588c",
                                        "entry_id": "4bfc3f13-ec2d-3b2f-b99c-db651f568f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not following the regular or expected patterns of inflection in a given language."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a word"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "897d602a-c601-4018-aa0a-45fc26df8bf0",
                                                "sense_id": "fd543950-fa5e-3566-83e1-2be3d658588c",
                                                "text": "\"Calves\", \"cacti\", and \"children\" are irregular plurals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5a612a0-00d1-4532-b075-0820767bfce1",
                                                "sense_id": "fd543950-fa5e-3566-83e1-2be3d658588c",
                                                "text": "To buy is an irregular English verb, its past simple and past participle tense is \"bought\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba8cccfd-3576-43e0-9170-454bdbf5b964",
                                                "sense_id": "fd543950-fa5e-3566-83e1-2be3d658588c",
                                                "text": "I hate learning all the irregular conjugations in French."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "irregular",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad1254bb-3bcc-3447-a606-a10b9febcf47",
                                        "entry_id": "b238bf39-975a-3f54-935c-0d5635acd768",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soldier who is not a member of an official military force and who may not use regular army tactics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1be327a-c005-3929-9f93-b76ae177275a",
                                        "entry_id": "b238bf39-975a-3f54-935c-0d5635acd768",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who does not regularly attend a venue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9950ca8-5775-480d-b018-e3ca3236042a",
                                                "sense_id": "d1be327a-c005-3929-9f93-b76ae177275a",
                                                "text": "There's one neighborhood tavern where the regulars and irregulars go after a hard day to unlax and rewind, throw back a few, and just hang out - you know the one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
